    <ol>
      <li>Keep this controller disabled and stop every other process that controls the same shelf.</li>
      <li>Confirm Unraid can see both the shelf's persistent serial adapter and its SES enclosure before adding it.</li>
      <li>Temporarily enable <b>Test likely FTDI adapters</b>, refresh discovery, add a shelf, choose its persistent serial adapter, and save.</li>
      <li>Select <b>Identify &amp; test</b>. The app verifies the console, proves the 20% → 50% response, pairs the SES enclosure and disks, then independently proves the return to 20%.</li>
      <li>Repeat for every shelf. Confirm each shelf says <b>Commissioned: yes</b> and review its associated disks.</li>
      <li>Active connection testing turns off automatically when setup completes. Passive inventory remains available. Enable this controller only after every competing fan writer is disabled.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="md12xx-warning"><b>Recovery:</b> if a test cannot prove the final 20% state, keep every controller stopped and follow the on-screen recovery message before continuing.</p>
